sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Git as Git Repository
    participant Pipeline as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant ACR as Azure Container Registry
    participant TF_UKS as Terraform UK South
    participant TF_EUS2 as Terraform East US 2
    participant ContApp_UKS as Container Apps UKS
    participant ContApp_EUS2 as Container Apps EUS2
    participant TestRunner as AQA Test Runner
    participant TrafficMgr as Azure Traffic Manager
    participant Monitor as Monitoring

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 1: TRIGGER AND VALIDATION
    
    Dev->>Git: git push origin main
    activate Git
    Git->>Pipeline: Webhook triggers pipeline
    activate Pipeline
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Validate branch rules
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Check CI status
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Verify approvals
    Git-->>Pipeline: Trigger validated
    deactivate Git

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 2: BUILD AND TEST
    
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Checkout code (commit abc123)
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Set variables (COMMIT_SHA IMAGE_TAG)
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Run unit tests
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Lint Terraform code
    Pipeline-->>Pipeline: Build validation passed

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 3: DOCKER BUILD AND SCAN
    
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Build Docker image
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Security scan (Trivy/Snyk)
    Pipeline->>ACR: Push myacr.azurecr.io/app:abc123
    activate ACR
    ACR-->>Pipeline: Image pushed successfully
    deactivate ACR

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 4: UK SOUTH - TERRAFORM INIT
    
    Pipeline->>TF_UKS: cd environments/uks
    activate TF_UKS
    Pipeline->>TF_UKS: terraform init (Backend uks-prod.tfstate)
    TF_UKS->>TF_UKS: Initialize Azure backend
    TF_UKS-->>Pipeline: Backend initialized

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 5: UK SOUTH - TERRAFORM PLAN
    
    Pipeline->>TF_UKS: terraform plan with terraform.uks.tfvars
    TF_UKS->>TF_UKS: Load tfvars (region=uksouth)
    TF_UKS-->>Pipeline: Plan generated

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 6: UK SOUTH - TERRAFORM APPLY
    
    Pipeline->>TF_UKS: terraform apply
    TF_UKS->>ContApp_UKS: Create/Update Container App Environment
    activate ContApp_UKS
    TF_UKS->>ContApp_UKS: Configure networking (VNet)
    TF_UKS->>ContApp_UKS: Set revision mode multiple
    TF_UKS->>ContApp_UKS: Configure monitoring
    TF_UKS->>ContApp_UKS: Set replica configuration
    ContApp_UKS-->>TF_UKS: Resources created/updated
    TF_UKS-->>Pipeline: Apply complete with outputs

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 7: UK SOUTH - DEPLOY BLUE
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Check existing revisions
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Current uks-blue-v1-0-0 (100%)
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Deploy blue revision (Image abc123)
    ContApp_UKS->>ACR: Pull image
    ACR-->>ContApp_UKS: Image pulled
    ContApp_UKS->>ContApp_UKS: Create blue revision
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Blue deployed traffic 100%
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Health check blue
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Blue healthy

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 8: UK SOUTH - DEPLOY GREEN
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Deploy green revision (Traffic 0%)
    ContApp_UKS->>ContApp_UKS: Create green revision
    ContApp_UKS->>ContApp_UKS: Add green label
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Green created

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 9: UK SOUTH - AQA TESTING
    
    Pipeline->>TestRunner: Trigger AQA tests (UKS Green)
    activate TestRunner
    TestRunner->>ContApp_UKS: Run 9-layer test suite
    ContApp_UKS-->>TestRunner: All tests passed
    TestRunner-->>Pipeline: UKS AQA validation complete
    deactivate TestRunner

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 10: UK SOUTH - TRAFFIC SWITCH
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Canary 10% (Blue 90% Green 10%)
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Traffic updated
    Pipeline->>Monitor: Monitor UKS (5 min)
    activate Monitor
    Monitor-->>Pipeline: Metrics healthy
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Canary 50% (Blue 50% Green 50%)
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Traffic updated
    Pipeline->>Monitor: Monitor UKS (10 min)
    Monitor-->>Pipeline: Metrics healthy
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Full switch (Blue 0% Green 100%)
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Traffic updated
    Pipeline->>Monitor: Verify production health
    Monitor-->>Pipeline: UKS production healthy
    deactivate Monitor

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 11: UK SOUTH - FINALIZATION
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Swap labels (Green becomes Blue)
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Labels updated
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Cleanup old revisions
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: Cleanup complete
    deactivate TF_UKS
    
    Note over Pipeline,ContApp_UKS: UK South Deployment Complete

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 12: EAST US 2 - TERRAFORM INIT
    
    Pipeline->>TF_EUS2: cd environments/eus2
    activate TF_EUS2
    Pipeline->>TF_EUS2: terraform init (Backend eus2-prod.tfstate)
    TF_EUS2->>TF_EUS2: Initialize Azure backend
    TF_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Backend initialized

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 13: EAST US 2 - TERRAFORM PLAN
    
    Pipeline->>TF_EUS2: terraform plan with terraform.eus2.tfvars
    TF_EUS2->>TF_EUS2: Load tfvars (region=eastus2)
    TF_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Plan generated

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 14: EAST US 2 - TERRAFORM APPLY
    
    Pipeline->>TF_EUS2: terraform apply
    TF_EUS2->>ContApp_EUS2: Create/Update Container App Environment
    activate ContApp_EUS2
    TF_EUS2->>ContApp_EUS2: Configure networking (VNet)
    TF_EUS2->>ContApp_EUS2: Set revision mode multiple
    TF_EUS2->>ContApp_EUS2: Configure monitoring
    TF_EUS2->>ContApp_EUS2: Set replica configuration
    ContApp_EUS2-->>TF_EUS2: Resources created/updated
    TF_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Apply complete with outputs

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 15: EAST US 2 - DEPLOY BLUE AND GREEN
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Deploy blue revision (Image abc123)
    ContApp_EUS2->>ACR: Pull image
    ACR-->>ContApp_EUS2: Image pulled
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Blue deployed traffic 100%
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Health check blue
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Blue healthy
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Deploy green revision (Traffic 0%)
    ContApp_EUS2->>ContApp_EUS2: Create green revision
    ContApp_EUS2->>ContApp_EUS2: Add green label
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Green created

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 16: EAST US 2 - AQA TESTING
    
    Pipeline->>TestRunner: Trigger AQA tests (EUS2 Green)
    activate TestRunner
    TestRunner->>ContApp_EUS2: Run 9-layer test suite
    ContApp_EUS2-->>TestRunner: All tests passed
    TestRunner-->>Pipeline: EUS2 AQA validation complete
    deactivate TestRunner

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 17: EAST US 2 - TRAFFIC SWITCH
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Canary 10% (Blue 90% Green 10%)
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Traffic updated
    Pipeline->>Monitor: Monitor EUS2 (5 min)
    activate Monitor
    Monitor-->>Pipeline: Metrics healthy
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Canary 50% (Blue 50% Green 50%)
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Traffic updated
    Pipeline->>Monitor: Monitor EUS2 (10 min)
    Monitor-->>Pipeline: Metrics healthy
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Full switch (Blue 0% Green 100%)
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Traffic updated
    Pipeline->>Monitor: Verify production health
    Monitor-->>Pipeline: EUS2 production healthy
    deactivate Monitor

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 18: EAST US 2 - FINALIZATION
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Swap labels (Green becomes Blue)
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Labels updated
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Cleanup old revisions
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: Cleanup complete
    deactivate TF_EUS2
    
    Note over Pipeline,ContApp_EUS2: East US 2 Deployment Complete

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 19: CROSS-REGION VALIDATION
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_UKS: Verify UKS endpoint health
    ContApp_UKS-->>Pipeline: UKS healthy
    
    Pipeline->>ContApp_EUS2: Verify EUS2 endpoint health
    ContApp_EUS2-->>Pipeline: EUS2 healthy
    
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Test data consistency
    Pipeline-->>Pipeline: Cross-region validation passed

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 20: GLOBAL CONFIGURATION
    
    Pipeline->>TrafficMgr: Update Traffic Manager/Front Door
    activate TrafficMgr
    Pipeline->>TrafficMgr: Configure health probes (UKS and EUS2)
    Pipeline->>TrafficMgr: Set routing (Geographic/Performance)
    TrafficMgr-->>Pipeline: Global routing updated
    
    Pipeline->>TrafficMgr: Verify global endpoint
    TrafficMgr-->>Pipeline: Global health check passed
    deactivate TrafficMgr

    Note over Dev,Monitor: STEP 21: REPORTING AND MONITORING
    
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Generate deployment report
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Store artifacts (states, test reports, logs)
    
    Pipeline->>Monitor: Enable enhanced monitoring (24h)
    activate Monitor
    Monitor->>ContApp_UKS: Track metrics
    Monitor->>ContApp_EUS2: Track metrics
    Monitor-->>Pipeline: Monitoring active
    
    Pipeline->>Dev: Send success notification
    
    deactivate Pipeline
    deactivate ContApp_UKS
    deactivate ContApp_EUS2
    deactivate Monitor
    
    Note over Dev,Monitor: Multi-Region Deployment Complete
